ymix: a proxy URL protocol for sandboxed file access

Adds libavformat/ymix.c plus its four registration points. FFmpeg reaches a
file it may not open directly by talking to a helper over a Unix socket —
on Android that is the only way to touch a content:// document.

Generated from Khang-NT/FFmpeg; applies to upstream 90cca8111b7db00f33ca0910f599957553a68843.
